id: pm-ts-starter-audit104
title: Full development audit is blocked by unpatched braces through required latest pm-ops
description: npm audit reports 4 high findings rooted in braces 3.0.3 through fast-glob 3.3.3 / micromatch / pm-ops 2026.10.4. npm maximum braces version is 3.0.3; GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm lists no patched version. Requires a canonical dependency replacement or a patched braces publication; retain required tool pins and full audit honesty.
